WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:10,180
I stayed with her even when her car was lost.

2
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:26,340
If you know how to drive, look for her.

3
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:39,130
Captain Beauty, please untie me. I won’t run away.

4
00:00:39,370 --> 00:00:43,980
Beautiful thought

5
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:46,720
Can you drive like this?
